+/**
+ * At exit, the workers given back while this program's memory is still its own: the kernel parks them only when
+ * /dev/gpu closes, after the memory has gone, and a worker still running (a ship's path waiting for the drawing,
+ * which stores its answer every pass) wrote into pages given to the next program (the second start of the game
